>   A suggestion: Hypodermic syringes as items in NetHack.
>   Applying an empty syringe would cause the game to prompt you for a
>   potion from your inventory to fill it. Applying a full syringe
>   would cause it to prompt you for a direction.
>
>Nifty, and doesn't require any new commands.
>
>   The primary use would be injecting monsters with paralysis,
>   sickness, or whatever other nastiness springs to mind. This would be
>   more effective than throwing the potion bottle at the monster, and the
>   player would be guaranteed not to inhale the fumes.
